  "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\nLogic: Result = Larger number − 2 × Smaller number\n\nCheck:\n\n11 − 3 → 11 − 2×3 = 11 − 6 = 5\n\n14 − 5 → 14 − 2×5 = 14 − 10 = 4\n\nApply to 18 − 6:\n\n18 − 2×6 = 18 − 12 = 6\n\nHence, the correct answer is **Option 2.**",
